{"study_accession":"PRJNA692986","secondary_study_accession":"SRP302196","title":"Circulating neutrophil transcriptomics in HBV-ACLF patients.","description":"The transcriptomic profiles of circulating neutrophils were compared between patients with ACLF (N=10), patients with CLC (N=10) and HC (N=10). Compared with CLC-neutrophils, the expression of 1022 genes were found to be upregulated in ACLF-neutrophils, and 1101 genes were downregulated. And compared to HC, the expression of 726 genes were up-regulated in ACLF-neutrophils, and 711 genes were down-regulated. The pathway analysis identified mutiple pathways enriched or down-regulated in ACLF-neutrophils when comparing with neutrophils from CLC or HC groups. Overall design: The transcriptomic profiles of circulating neutrophils were compared between patients with ACLF (N=10), patients with CLC (N=10) and HC (N=10).","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":30,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN17373569","study_accession":"PRJNA692986","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"HC8","description":"HC8","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5024785","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-02-26","attributes":[["source_name","HC8"],["tissue","Peripheral whole blood"],["cell_type","circulating neutrophils"],["group","HC"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13455197","experiment_accession":"SRX9868070","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":27681507,"base_count":8304452100,"first_public":"2024-02-26","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM5024785: HC8 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN17373570","study_accession":"PRJNA692986","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"CLC6","description":"CLC6","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5024773","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-02-26","attributes":[["source_name","CLC6"],["tissu